      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5e80e374206da6376a909562|full_name}\nNice idea however this is more something that the community of map makers or world creaters (same thing) will have to do. You can give it a shot yourself if you'd like to.\nHere's a link to the offical docs to get you started:\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/creating-your-first-world",
