  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi my name is Thomas and an idea came to me while this quarantine thing is going on. the idea was to implant real life areas by using google maps or and map generating API to vr chat (and I'm not talking about just landmarks). Think about it a group of friends from different places going to the grand canyon with leaving there home! i cant think of a way to specifically do it, i saw  a Minecraft mod that took those APIs and generated realistic landmarks. i haven't fully explored vr chat so I'm not sure if you guys have already done it or not. If you can let me know if you will consider this idea its really appreciated, or let me know if there is already such a thing\nIt can also a 3d generated version of the places",
